### 10. Stop and remove


docker container stop program-2-container
docker container rm program-2-container
docker image rm program-2
```

### Final structure

Program-2/
├── Dockerfile
├── package.json
├── package-lock.json
├── node_modules/
└── src/
    └── index.js
```

The key concept in this program is **two-stage building**: the first stage builds the application, and the second stage creates the production image using only the required files. prog2
